/-!
# D11-8: the boundary reduction (generated by emit_assembly1011.py)

`9/10 ≤ a < 1` is driven into the boundary box: σ ≤ S_b (`sigma_boundary`),
the localization key gives `10a(1−u) ≤ (1−a)(S_b(1+a)−10)`, hence
`η² ≤ Y_b²(1−a)`; substituting `x = √(1−a)`, `Y = η/x` and pulling back
`U = (25/8)x`, `V = (10/17 : ℝ)·Y`, the boundary hEq turns the nonpositive
certificate value into `x²·(box polynomial) ≤ 0`, and `x² > 0` finishes.
